    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Playful and engaging designs that appeal to children, making brushing more fun<br\/>✔ 360° cleaning coverage for a full-mouth brushing experience<br\/>✔ Designed to support daily oral care more easily than traditional brushes<br\/>✔ Gentle, soft bristles are perfect for young and developing teeth, ensuring a comfortable brushing experience<br\/>✔ Designed with small hands in mind — U Brush has an easy-to-hold handle for better control<br\/>✔ U Brush supports a more thorough and consistent clean<br\/>✔ A great tool to help build long-term brushing habits for kids<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the Kids U Brush",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The Kids Silicone U Brush is very easy and simple to use.<\/p><ol><li><strong>Apply Toothpaste:<\/strong> Squeeze a pea-sized amount of toothpaste onto the silicon bristles.<\/li><li><strong>Brush Gently:<\/strong> Brush your teeth and gums gently, moving the U Brush in a circular motion.<\/li><li><strong>Rinse:<\/strong> After brushing for two minutes, rinse your mouth and the U Brush.<\/li><li><strong>Enjoy the Fun:<\/strong> Have fun with the playful design and flavors while keeping your smile healthy!<\/li><\/ol><p>That's it! Happy brushing with U Brush!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Kids Silicone U Brush consists of:<\/p><p>1x Kids Silicone U Brush<\/p><p>1x Playful Packaging Design<\/p><p>1x Manual<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why is a U Brush better than a regular toothbrush?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>There are many reasons why over 1M+ parents have made the switch to a U Brush for their child:<br\/><br\/>Compared to a regular toothbrush, a U Brush offers distinct advantages — especially for younger users and developing brushing habits:<br\/><br\/>✔ Covers all teeth at once, including areas children may miss while brushing<br\/>✔ Supports consistent gum care as part of daily routines<br\/>✔ Makes brushing feel fun and playful instead of a chore<br\/>✔ Helps children build confidence and independence in oral care<br\/>✔ Silicone bristles are softer and more flexible than traditional nylon — ideal for gentle brushing<br\/><br\/>Please note Kids Silicone U Brush may also be referred to as: Kids Toothbrush, Children Friendly Brush, Children's Oral Care Tool, Playful Toothbrush, Kids Dental Brush, Fun Toothbrush, Happy Brush, U Brushing, Child Safe Toothbrush, Young Smile Brush<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Supervision for Young Children:<\/strong> Always supervise young children while using the U Brush to ensure proper brushing and to prevent accidental swallowing of toothpaste.<br\/><br\/><strong>Flavoured Toothpaste:<\/strong> If using flavoured toothpaste, remind children to spit it out after brushing and avoid swallowing.<br\/><strong><br\/>Regular Replacement:<\/strong> Replace the U Brush regularly—just like any toothbrush—for continued effectiveness. We recommend replacing every 3 months.<br\/><strong><br\/>Avoid Sharing:<\/strong> Do not allow children to share their U Brush with others to help reduce the risk of cross-contamination.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
